  syntax 1.0
  rfc 8446 section 4
  chain: [ecdsa_p256]
  uut server {
    versions: [tls13]
    require_client_cert: true
  }
  xfail gnutls "parses any handshake length and checks its size limit only once the whole message has arrived (CHECK_SIZE in lib/handshake.c), so it waits for the announced 16 MiB"
  flow handshake until send CertificateVerify {
    send CertificateVerify @ set[handshake.length, 0..2] = 0xff, @ fragment 4 hold_all
    wait 300 ms
